<title>DENMARK: Danish Sept wholesale prices up 1.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish Sept wholesale prices up 1.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices did not rise in September from August but were up 1.0 percent from September 1995, the national statistics office said on Friday.  </p>
<p>					Sept 1996  Aug 1996   Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    0.0	 0.0	  +0.2</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)    +1.0	+1.2	  +2.9</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100) 104.2     104.2	 103.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. An analyst panel polled by Reuters forecast average WPI rises of 1.4 percent on an annual basis and 0.3 percent on a monthly basis for September. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
